  "title": "Watermelon Pickles",
  "description": "These watermelon pickles are cubes of watermelon rind pickled in a sweet and tangy brine made with sugar, vinegar, spices, and maraschino cherries.",
  "authors": [
    "KERYNE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:50:31-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-07-24T05:26:22-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT15M",
  "cook_time": "PT60M",
  "total_time": "PT1275M",
  "yield": [
    "24",
    "6 (1-pint) jars"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Condiment"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup canning salt",
    "1 gallon water",
    "16 cups (1-inch) cubes watermelon rind",
    "1 gallon water",
    "3 cinnamon sticks",
    "1 teaspoon whole allspice",
    "1 teaspoon whole cloves",
    "2 cups white vinegar (5% acidity)",
    "3 cups white sugar, or more to taste",
    "12 maraschino cherries, halved",
    "1 lemon, thinly sliced",
    "6 1-pint canning jars with lids and rings"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E_PTi2USSmsRSToN8K2u8mcuNbI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-005-step-01-cf7f7ac1e10c4665abcb3b12dd64d847.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir canning salt into 1 gallon water in a large container until dissolved; add watermelon rind. Cover the container with plastic wrap or a lid and let sit 12 hours. Drain and rinse completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8qvROSFiL7odB-dL78xZw0he44o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-006-step-02-0ef9d918e6974be39b499e0bc1afd810.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine drained watermelon rind and 1 gallon water in a stock pot. Bring the water to a boil, reduce heat to medium-low, and simmer until the rind is tender, 45 minutes to 1 hour; drain and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B6WmCmGeZVLQrgEzXtpQQrpIFjI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-007-step-03-59330393623c4ff28ff092b23fbe4515.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put cinnamon sticks, allspice, and cloves in cheesecloth or spice bag. Combine vinegar, sugar, spice bag, maraschino cherries, and lemon slices in the stock pot; stir until sugar is dissolved.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zpv_yMjWID8HTd15_hUFlVbKFIs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-008-step-04-293217331cf343a3bbb8ec52f5367eab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add watermelon rind to the pot; bring to a boil, reduce heat to medium-low, and simmer until the rind is transparent, about 5-10 minutes. Remove the spice bag and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EFJ51HaqxoWW0VQLl3lKNtiT7LE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-009-step-05-cadbf30c4c1b43cd95d87ea987a9d62b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sterilize 6 (1-pint) jars and lids in boiling water for at least 5 minutes. Put one whole clove into each jar. Break cinnamon sticks into pieces and put 1 piece into each jar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cT-5QIAvOpef5wdSzizoTU_lkyo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-010-step-06-e5ad5bebdb2446c7b549e4c7631335f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pack the watermelon rind with the vinegar mixture into the hot, sterilized jars, filling the jars to within 1/4 inch of the top. Run a knife or a thin spatula around the insides of the jars after they have been filled to remove any air bubbles. Wipe the rims of the jars with a moist paper towel to remove any food residue. Top with lids and screw on rings.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vlayVMM7FAm-KPnDIcUAAGlqYnQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-011-step-07-2082edf87be9459a960f7696b4c4c8ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water. Bring to a boil and lower jars into the boiling water using a holder. Leave a 2-inch space between the jars. Pour in more boiling water if necessary to bring the water level to at least 1 inch above the tops of the jars. Bring the water to a rolling boil, cover the pot, and process for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MrpLxwnnVAsMJB4KzGsnPSYBW2k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-012-step-08-b162e13713a844f19c4d676200330093.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the jars from the stockpot and place onto a cloth-covered or wood surface, several inches apart, until cool. Once cool, press the top of each lid with a finger, ensuring that the seal is tight (lid does not move up or down at all). Store in a cool, dark area.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/R3IIzs0-U7ex6Nl_-inlsIWO134=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228065-watermelon-pickles-VAT-013-step-09-a55a6c08b32944af928cf1593641edd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228065/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
